	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Lifecycle - System API - Okta API Token Enabled or Modified",
	"Description": "An Okta API token was enabled or had its settings changed. Re-enabling a token that was parked, or relaxing the network condition on one, restores a credential that bypasses interactive sign-in.\n\nEvent types: system.api_token.enable, system.api_token.update\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/api/openapi/okta-management/management/tag/SystemLog/",
